  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Find Common Healing Potion by SKU",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 200', () => {\r\n  pm.response.to.have.status(200);\r\n});\r\n\r\npm.test('Returns Common Healing Potion at the expected price', () => {\r\n  const body = pm.response.json();\r\n\r\n  pm.expect(body.schemaVersion).to.equal(1);\r\n  pm.expect(body.products).to.be.an('array').with.lengthOf(1);\r\n  pm.expect(body.total).to.equal(body.products.length);\r\n\r\n  const product = body.products[0];\r\n\r\n  pm.expect(product.sku).to.equal('SSC-POT-0001');\r\n  pm.expect(product.name).to.equal('Common Healing Potion');\r\n  pm.expect(product.price).to.deep.equal({\r\n    amount: 5,\r\n    denomination: 'Copper',\r\n    unit: 'ounce',\r\n  });\r\n});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products?q=SSC-POT-0001",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "products"],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "q",
              "value": "SSC-POT-0001"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "## Purpose\n\nFind Common Healing Potion by its SKU using the catalog search endpoint.\n\n## Request\n\nGET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?q=SSC-POT-0001\n\nThe `q` parameter searches the catalog. Because `status` is omitted,  \nthe API defaults to canonical products.\n\n## Expected response\n\n- HTTP 200.\n    \n- Schema version 1.\n    \n- Exactly one product: Common Healing Potion, SKU SSC-POT-0001.\n    \n- Price: 5 Copper per ounce.\n    \n- `total` equals 1 and matches the number of returned products.\n    \n\n## Environment\n\nSelect Spellbound Local to run against the local API."
      },
